      "slot": {
        "source_byte_length": 77,
        "ko_cp949_byte_length": 60,
        "fits_original_slot": true
      },
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "entry_id": 11,
      "heap_offset": 1269,
      "raw_hex": "205468617420776173206A757374206120646F6720686F776C696E672E0A0A54686572652077617320736F6D657468696E67206D6F7265207468616E20746861742E",
      "source": " That was just a dog howling.\n\nThere was something more than that.",
      "ko": "그건 그냥 개가 짖은 거야.\n그것 말고 뭔가 더 있었어.",
      "status": "needs_human_review",
      "timing": {
        "start_frame": 850,
        "end_frame": 890
      },
      "slot": {
        "source_byte_length": 66,
        "ko_cp949_byte_length": 51,
        "fits_original_slot": true
      },
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "entry_id": 12,
      "heap_offset": 1336,
      "raw_hex": "2057656C6C2049206469646E2774206865617220616E797468696E672E2049207468696E6B207468697320706C616365206973206A7573742067657474696E6720757320616C6C2073706F6F6B65642E",
      "source": " Well I didn't hear anything. I think this place is just getting us all spooked.",
      "ko": "난 아무것도 못 들었어. 여기 분위기에 다들 겁먹은 것 같아.",
      "status": "needs_human_review",
      "timing": {
        "start_frame": 890,
        "end_frame": 950
      },
      "slot": {
        "source_byte_length": 80,
        "ko_cp949_byte_length": 57,
        "fits_original_slot": true
      },
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "entry_id": 13,
      "heap_offset": 1417,
      "raw_hex": "2041726520796F75207375726520796F752077616E7420746F20676F207468726F756768207769746820746869733F20596F752063616E206261636B206F757420617420616E792074696D652E",
      "source": " Are you sure you want to go through with this? You can back out at any time.",
      "ko": "정말 이대로 할 거야? 지금이라도 그만둬도 돼.",
      "status": "needs_human_review",
      "timing": {
        "start_frame": 950,
        "end_frame": 990
      },
      "slot": {
        "source_byte_length": 77,
        "ko_cp949_byte_length": 44,
        "fits_original_slot": true
      },
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "entry_id": 14,
      "heap_offset": 1495,
      "raw_hex": "20427574206F6620636F7572736520696620796F75206469642C20796F7527642070726F6261626C79206E65766572206C69766520646F776E2074686520636869636B656E206A6F6B65732E0A0A54686174277320747275652E",
      "source": " But of course if you did, you'd probably never live down the chicken jokes.\n\nThat's true.",
      "ko": "물론 그랬다간 겁쟁이라고 평생 놀림받겠지만.\n그건 그렇지.",
      "status": "needs_human_review",
      "timing": {
        "start_frame": 990,
        "end_frame": 1030
      },
      "slot": {
        "source_byte_length": 90,
        "ko_cp949_byte_length": 56,
        "fits_original_slot": true
      },
      "notes": []
