      "heap_offset": 1586,
      "raw_hex": "20596F75276C6C20626520616C6C2072696768742E20436F6D65206F6E2C204920646F6E27742077616E7420746F206265206C61746520666F7220746865206D6F7669652E205765276C6C206265206261636B206174206461776E20746F206C657420796F75206F75742E0A0A42796520627965210A53656520796121",
      "source": " You'll be all right. Come on, I don't want to be late for the movie. We'll be back at dawn to let you out.\n\nBye bye!\nSee ya!",
      "ko": "넌 괜찮을 거야. 영화에 늦겠다. 새벽에 돌아와 꺼내 줄게.\n잘 있어! 또 봐!",
